{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bat &amp; Ball</strong> is a fast, focused baseball-inspired challenge where every swing counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around pure reflexes and precision, the gameplay is simple to learn and brutally satisfying to master. You control everything with just your mouse \u2014 time your swings, keep the streak alive, and don\u2019t let anything drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No tutorials. No fluff. Just you, the bat, and the rising pressure of perfection.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/132f0f782d7647e345a65ac94977e3d2.poster.avif?t=1755022776\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/132f0f782d7647e345a65ac94977e3d2.webm?t=1755022776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/132f0f782d7647e345a65ac94977e3d2.mp4?t=1755022776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Microtransactions. No Shortcuts.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no loot boxes, no premium currencies. Every cosmetic bat and ball skin is unlocked through gameplay \u2014 not through extra purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once earned, skins become tradable Steam Inventory items, so you can collect, trade, or sell them on the Steam Marketplace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, minimalist gameplay focused on timing and rhythm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable cosmetic skins through skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Inventory support (marketable &amp; tradable items)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715720?t=1755022776","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715720?t=1755022776","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/a8032ce6d83abd9df8196964ae2f2730c01426a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755022776","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/a8032ce6d83abd9df8196964ae2f2730c01426a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755022776","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bat &amp; Ball</strong> is a fast, focused baseball-inspired challenge where every swing counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around pure reflexes and precision, the gameplay is simple to learn and brutally satisfying to master. You control everything with just your mouse \u2014 time your swings, keep the streak alive, and don\u2019t let anything drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No tutorials. No fluff. Just you, the bat, and the rising pressure of perfection.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/132f0f782d7647e345a65ac94977e3d2.poster.avif?t=1755022776\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/132f0f782d7647e345a65ac94977e3d2.webm?t=1755022776\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/extras/132f0f782d7647e345a65ac94977e3d2.mp4?t=1755022776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Microtransactions. No Shortcuts.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no loot boxes, no premium currencies. Every cosmetic bat and ball skin is unlocked through gameplay \u2014 not through extra purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once earned, skins become tradable Steam Inventory items, so you can collect, trade, or sell them on the Steam Marketplace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, minimalist gameplay focused on timing and rhythm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable cosmetic skins through skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Inventory support (marketable &amp; tradable items)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li></ul>","developers":["BritishInteractive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715720/d1893acd3bf24fde78d0948276b1200025b2bb42/header.jpg?t=1755022776","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257181887,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181887/movie480.mp4?t=1754976094","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181887/movie_max.mp4?t=1754976094"},"name":"Bat & Ball Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257181887/92bea66a93713153600c3b4faea4b9c6486c9620/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754976094","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181887/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754976094","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181887/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754976094"}}],"name":"Bat & Ball","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><